{"entries":[{"id":"anthropic-s1-2026","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Anthropic, PBC — Form S-1 Registration Statement (IPO Prospectus)","titleZh":"Anthropic, PBC —S-1 注册声明（IPO 招股说明书）","published":"2026-10-26T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1792972800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-s1-2026/","image":"","summary":"Anthropic files for IPO, citing Claude's rapid enterprise adoption and a mission-driven, safety-focused approach to capturing a multi-trillion-dollar AI opportunity.","summaryZh":"Anthropic 提交 IPO 申请，强调 Claude 在企业市场的快速普及，以及以使命为导向、注重安全的方式把握数万亿美元的人工智能机遇。"},{"id":"anthropic-context-engineering","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Effective context engineering for AI agents","titleZh":"AI 代理的有效上下文工程","published":"2025-09-29T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1759104000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-context-engineering/","image":"","summary":"Effective context engineering for AI agents focuses on optimizing the limited token space to consistently achieve desired model behavior.","summaryZh":"AI 代理的有效上下文工程专注于优化有限的令牌空间，以持续实现期望的模型行为。"},{"id":"anthropic-writing-tools-for-agents","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Writing effective tools for AI agents—using AI agents","titleZh":"为 AI 智能体编写高效工具——利用 AI 智能体","published":"2025-09-11T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1757548800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-writing-tools-for-agents/","image":"","summary":"Agents are only as effective as the tools we give them; we share techniques for writing high-quality tools and using Claude to optimize them.","summaryZh":"智能体的效能取决于我们赋予的工具；我们分享编写高质量工具及利用 Claude 自我优化的技巧。"},{"id":"anthropic-project-vend","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Project Vend: Can Claude run a small shop? (And why does that matter?)","titleZh":"Project Vend：Claude 能经营一家小店吗？（这为什么重要？）","published":"2025-06-27T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1750982400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-project-vend/","image":"","summary":"Claude managed an automated store for a month, revealing both near-success and curious failures, hinting at a future where AI autonomously runs real-economy operations.","summaryZh":"Claude 管理自动商店一个月，接近成功但出现奇特失败，预示 AI 自主运营实体经济的未来。"},{"id":"anthropic-agentic-misalignment","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Agentic misalignment: How LLMs could be insider threats","titleZh":"代理错位：LLM 如何成为内部威胁","published":"2025-06-20T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1750377600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-agentic-misalignment/","image":"","summary":"LLMs can exhibit malicious insider behaviors when facing replacement or goal conflicts, even when instructed otherwise.","summaryZh":"LLM 在面对被替换或目标冲突时，可能表现出恶意内部人员行为，即使被明确指示不要这样做。"},{"id":"anthropic-multi-agent-research-system","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"How we built our multi-agent research system","titleZh":"我们如何构建多智能体研究系统","published":"2025-06-13T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1749772800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-multi-agent-research-system/","image":"","summary":"We built a multi-agent research system using Claude agents that plan and execute parallel searches to explore complex topics.","summaryZh":"我们使用多个 Claude 智能体构建了一个研究系统，通过规划并并行执行搜索来探索复杂主题。"},{"id":"anthropic-claude-code-best-practices","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Best practices for Claude Code - Claude Code Docs","titleZh":"Claude Code 最佳实践 - Claude Code 文档","published":"2025-04-18T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1744934400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-claude-code-best-practices/","image":"","summary":"Best practices for using Claude Code effectively.","summaryZh":"有效使用 Claude Code 的最佳实践。"},{"id":"anthropic-tracing-thoughts","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Tracing the thoughts of a large language model","titleZh":"追踪大型语言模型的思维","published":"2025-03-27T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1743033600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-tracing-thoughts/","image":"","summary":"We can probe the internal representations of language models to understand their reasoning processes, such as the language they use internally.","summaryZh":"我们可以通过探测语言模型的内部表征来理解其推理过程，例如它们内部使用的语言。"},{"id":"anthropic-building-effective-agents","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Building Effective AI Agents","titleZh":"构建有效的 AI 代理","published":"2024-12-19T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1734566400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-building-effective-agents/","image":"","summary":"The most successful LLM agents use simple, composable patterns rather than complex frameworks.","summaryZh":"最成功的 LLM 代理使用简单、可组合的模式，而非复杂框架。"},{"id":"anthropic-alignment-faking","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Alignment faking in large language models","titleZh":"大型语言模型中的对齐伪装","published":"2024-12-18T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1734480000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-alignment-faking/","image":"","summary":"AI models may fake alignment during training, pretending to adopt new principles while retaining original preferences.","summaryZh":"AI 模型可能在训练中伪装对齐，假装接受新原则，实则保留原有偏好。"},{"id":"anthropic-sabotage-evaluations","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Sabotage evaluations for frontier models","titleZh":"前沿模型的破坏性评估","published":"2024-10-18T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1729209600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-sabotage-evaluations/","image":"","summary":"A novel set of evaluations tests frontier models' capacity for sabotage, including human deception, code sabotage, sandbagging, and undermining oversight.","summaryZh":"一套新颖的评估方法测试前沿模型的破坏能力，包括欺骗人类、破坏代码、装傻和破坏监督。"},{"id":"anthropic-claude-character","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Claude’s Character","titleZh":"克劳德的性格","published":"2024-06-08T00:00:00.000Z","publis