published":"2022-09-21T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1663718400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-2209.10652/","image":"","summary":"Polysemanticity in neural networks arises from storing sparse features in superposition, as demonstrated by a toy model with phase changes and connections to polytope geometry and adversarial examples.","summaryZh":"神经网络中的多义性源于在叠加中存储稀疏特征，通过一个具有相变、与多面体几何和对抗样本关联的玩具模型得以证明。"},{"id":"anthropic-2209.07858","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Red Teaming Language Models to Reduce Harms: Methods, Scaling Behaviors, and Lessons Learned","titleZh":"红队测试语言模型以减少危害：方法、扩展行为与经验教训","published":"2022-08-23T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1661212800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-2209.07858/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/413146288f7cb8e1.webp","summary":"Red teaming language models reveals scaling challenges for RLHF models and provides a dataset of 38,961 attacks.","summaryZh":"红队测试语言模型揭示了 RLHF 模型在扩展时的挑战，并提供了 38,961 次攻击的数据集。"},{"id":"anthropic-2207.05221","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Language Models (Mostly) Know What They Know","titleZh":"语言模型（大多）知道它们知道什么","published":"2022-07-11T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1657497600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-2207.05221/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/5a14e78bf235e8d7.webp","summary":"Language models can self-evaluate the validity of their own claims and predict answerability, with performance improving through self-consistency and context.","summaryZh":"语言模型能够自我评估自身主张的有效性并预测可回答性，通过自洽性和上下文信息可提升表现。"}]}